    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT OUR OTHER GAMES...</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/ce80284832a230e22f52e5e6ee93e6c0.avif?t=1674049627\" /></div><br>You are Maxim, an ordinary student from Pavlodar, who has been suffering from nightmares since childhood.<br><br>Lately they have been creeping into reality more and more often, driving you crazy! <br>The situation worsens when your own father disappears without leaving a trace. <br><br>Now it's up to you to look for him, unraveling the mystical secrets of your own past along the way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/e51708814724fdda9eb969d147d1e242.poster.avif?t=1674049627\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/e51708814724fdda9eb969d147d1e242.webp?t=1674049627\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/679cb8db3c03238594c783e731de3563.poster.avif?t=1674049627\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/679cb8db3c03238594c783e731de3563.webp?t=1674049627\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>Dashingly twisted detective plot will let you plunge into the mystical secrets of the past and the dark corners of the protagonist\u2019s mind. <br>Your phone and other interactive objects encountered throughout the game will help you along the way!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/8710d735709ea83ff477b8be45a5aa4a.poster.avif?t=1674049627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/8710d735709ea83ff477b8be45a5aa4a.webm?t=1674049627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>In our psychological horror, you will encounter a lot of unexplained phenomena that will chill your bones. <br>Advanced graphics and photogrammetry will help you achieve great immersion. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/56c75299d6f3915d6535ee5f547839ae.poster.avif?t=1674049627\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/56c75299d6f3915d6535ee5f547839ae.webp?t=1674049627\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>While investigating the crimes, you will repeatably stumble upon puzzles.<br>Solving these will open locked doors and also shed light on the events happening around you.<br>Be careful, because some of them hide secrets not many are able to find!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/7f2f6f7777cb8ecd11f4627cd90b8c04.poster.avif?t=1674049627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/7f2f6f7777cb8ecd11f4627cd90b8c04.webm?t=1674049627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/7f2f6f7777cb8ecd11f4627cd90b8c04.mp4?t=1674049627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Enemies never sleep! Hide in shelters and don't let them to see you, even those who don't have eyes!<br>Our game is full of different enemies! Can you outwit them all?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/b017a896d5ed79b3d1f010c441141147.poster.avif?t=1674049627\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/b017a896d5ed79b3d1f010c441141147.webm?t=1674049627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/ce80284832a230e22f52e5e6ee93e6c0.avif?t=1674049627\" /></div><br>You are Maxim, an ordinary student from Pavlodar, who has been suffering from nightmares since childhood.<br><br>Lately they have been creeping into reality more and more often, driving you crazy! <br>The situation worsens when your own father disappears without leaving a trace. <br><br>Now it's up to you to look for him, unraveling the mystical secrets of your own past along the way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/e51708814724fdda9eb969d147d1e242.poster.avif?t=1674049627\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/e51708814724fdda9eb969d147d1e242.webp?t=1674049627\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/679cb8db3c03238594c783e731de3563.poster.avif?t=1674049627\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/679cb8db3c03238594c783e731de3563.webp?t=1674049627\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>Dashingly twisted detective plot will let you plunge into the mystical secrets of the past and the dark corners of the protagonist\u2019s mind. <br>Your phone and other interactive objects encountered throughout the game will help you along the way!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833770/extras/8710d735709ea83ff477b8be45a5aa4a.poster.avif?t=1674049627\" ><source src=